WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.334 --> 00:00:11.235
In May, we have Parents' Day.

2
00:00:11.236 --> 00:00:18.022
On this day, we thank our mother and father for everything they do for us.

3
00:00:18.023 --> 00:00:22.832
Bada and I are planning a surprise.

4
00:00:22.833 --> 00:00:25.870
Hana: May 8 is Parents' Day, Bada.

5
00:00:25.871 --> 00:00:27.508
Bada: What's that?

6
00:00:27.509 --> 00:00:30.704
Hana: It's a special day for Mom and Dad.

7
00:00:30.705 --> 00:00:39.888
Let's give them a big surprise!

8
00:00:39.889 --> 00:00:41.903
Bada: What are you doing?

9
00:00:41.904 --> 00:00:44.876
Hana: I'm making a card for Mom and Dad.

10
00:00:44.877 --> 00:00:47.048
Bada: Can I make one too?

11
00:00:47.049 --> 00:00:53.710
Hana: Of course. Here you go.

12
00:00:53.711 --> 00:00:56.616
Bada: Why did you buy the flowers?

13
00:00:56.617 --> 00:01:02.977
Hana: On Parents' Day we give Mom and Dad red carnations.

14
00:01:02.978 --> 00:01:04.132
Bada: Why?

15
00:01:04.133 --> 00:01:10.260
Hana: Red carnations mean that we love them very much.

16
00:01:10.261 --> 00:01:16.590
Hana: Bada, on Parents' Day we are going to surprise Mom and Dad. Okay?

17
00:01:16.591 --> 00:01:17.985
Bada: Okay.

18
00:01:17.986 --> 00:01:19.993
Hana: So don't say anything.

19
00:01:19.994 --> 00:01:27.911
It's a secret.

20
00:01:27.912 --> 00:01:34.254
Dad: Hey, guys! What are you doing here?

21
00:01:34.255 --> 00:01:36.982
Hana: Oh, hi, Dad!

22
00:01:36.983 --> 00:01:39.123
Dad: Come on, let's go home.

23
00:01:39.124 --> 00:01:41.047
Bada: It's a nice day.

24
00:01:41.048 --> 00:01:43.261
Bada: Let's walk, Hana.

25
00:01:43.262 --> 00:01:45.909
We'll see you at home, Dad!

26
00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:53.011
Dad: Okay. See you!

27
00:01:53.012 --> 00:01:56.277
Dad: Hana and Bada are acting strangely.

28
00:01:56.278 --> 00:01:59.218
Mom: It seems they are hiding a secret.

29
00:01:59.219 --> 00:02:01.337
Dad: What kind of secret?

30
00:02:01.338 --> 00:02:07.442
Mom: I don't know.

31
00:02:07.443 --> 00:02:12.452
Hana: I think we should cook Mom and Dad dinner tomorrow night.

32
00:02:12.453 --> 00:02:15.831
Bada: But I don't know how to cook.

33
00:02:15.832 --> 00:02:19.360
Hana: Let's see . . . What do they like?

34
00:02:19.361 --> 00:02:23.732
Bada: They like peanut butter and jelly sandwiches.

35
00:02:23.733 --> 00:02:27.103
Hana: Oh, Bada, that's what you like.

36
00:02:27.104 --> 00:02:31.554
Let's make spaghetti!

37
00:02:31.555 --> 00:02:34.473
Bada: Mom! Can you help me?

38
00:02:34.474 --> 00:02:39.104
Mom: Later, Bada. I have to cook dinner now.

39
00:02:39.105 --> 00:02:43.576
Bada: Help me, please.

40
00:02:43.577 --> 00:02:46.874
Hana: Now, I need to make the pasta.

41
00:02:46.875 --> 00:02:54.448
Where does Mom keep the saucepan?

42
00:02:54.449 --> 00:02:57.162
Dad: Hi, Hana. Where's your Mom?

43
00:02:57.163 --> 00:02:59.211
What are you doing?

44
00:02:59.212 --> 00:03:02.609
Hana: Dad! You're not supposed to be here!

45
00:03:02.610 --> 00:03:05.714
You'll find out soon. Please!

46
00:03:05.715 --> 00:03:16.013
Dad: Okay, okay.

47
00:03:16.014 --> 00:03:19.088
Mom: Can I open my eyes now?

48
00:03:19.089 --> 00:03:23.524
Hana & Bada: Yes. Happy Parents' Day!

49
00:03:23.525 --> 00:03:30.245
Dad: What a nice surprise!

50
00:03:30.246 --> 00:03:32.607
Bada: Thank you, Mom and Dad.

51
00:03:32.608 --> 00:03:38.506
We love you!

52
00:03:38.507 --> 00:03:43.056
Bada and I were so happy to surprise Mom and Dad.

53
00:03:43.057 --> 00:03:46.833
We are so grateful to have them as our parents.

54
00:03:46.834 --> 00:03:50.899
What will you do for your parents on that special day?
